    | array         | list              |
    +---------------+-------------------+
    | string        | str               |
    +---------------+-------------------+
    | number (int)  | int               |
    +---------------+-------------------+
    | number (real) | float             |
    +---------------+-------------------+
    | true          | True              |
    +---------------+-------------------+
    | false         | False             |
    +---------------+-------------------+
    | null          | None              |

